{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"sections\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"read\": \"all\",\n      \"long\": \"有些感受堵在心里，我理不清，也不想让它们露出来，只好装作平静。\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"勉强\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"read\": \"all\",\n      \"long\": \"我想起那段亲切幸福的日子，如今再回不去，怀念里压着失落。\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"read\": \"all\",\n      \"long\": \"我总想，若当时不是那样，结果会不会不同？明知无解，仍放不下。\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"read\": \"all\",\n      \"long\": \"想得太满时，我像隔着一层看自己，旧事模糊了些；可失落并未过去。\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"read\": \"main\",\n      \"long\": \"我想留住那些好时候，却又不愿困在里面；念头互相打断，理不出答案。\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"read\": \"part\",\n      \"long\": \"念头一个接一个冒出来，像有什么在催我理清心里的事，可我连先想哪件都不知道。\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"勉强\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"read\": \"all\",\n      \"long\": \"我向往温暖、有归属感的生活，不必解释也能安心待着。\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"read\": \"main\",\n      \"long\": \"这不是头一回：平静时旧日难过又回来，搅乱安稳，让我烦躁。\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"read\": \"main\",\n      \"long\": \"过去的好、眼下的难受和对安宁的盼望一齐涌来，生活兴致短暂回来，却仍不稳。\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"read\": \"main\",\n      \"long\": \"那阵劲头过去，我对自己和旧事都感到陌生，安静里有些孤单，像找不到位置。\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"read\": \"all\",\n      \"long\": \"我慢慢能从难受里退开些，那些回忆还是一段段冒出来，我就不急着排顺。\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"read\": \"main\",\n      \"long\": \"我不再硬压想念，允许舍不得多留一会儿，把它当作曾珍惜过的痕迹。\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"read\": \"all\",\n      \"long\": \"圆满忽然断裂，旧日忧伤压回；我急着找回安宁，却再也接不上。\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S14\",\n      \"read\": \"all\",\n      \"long\": \"最后，我紧绷的心思突然断开；没有缓解，也没有和解，我仍不知能否带着忧伤安稳过下去。\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"overall\": \"S06最明显读不完，14秒内连主句都难以完整读完；S05、S08、S09、S10、S12只能优先读主句，次组的小字和词容易来不及看。S13和S14虽然时间较充足，但情绪转折和抽象表达堆得比较密，尤其S14的“来路不明的力量逼近”缺少具体指向，容易感到情绪很重，却不清楚究竟是什么在推动这种感受。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "30b7c858-1f07-4a89-8048-c28c73ac7451", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T142004164643Z", "elapsed_seconds": 124.578, "completed_utc": "2026-11-05T14:22:08.745825+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "55267fc434ab23045200bbc3518b86683d0e6383cac7f31e882eb87cf2ff3e2b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e